Jaws Scenario
Difficulty : 8
Bonus : 80
--------------------------------------------------------------
Although your enemy is rumored to be ensconced behind an impregnable fortress, it is probably that he will not remain there.  His goal is to spread his tentacles from his base, entwine and smother you.
Your weapon is your Mage Tor technology and the vast energy that you can bring to bear on the enemy.
You must remove the Human threat from this land so that it becomes safe for all members of our glorious Species.

